    <!-- ── Description ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <dc:description xml:lang="en">A poor young man named Han Li enters a sect to practice cultivation and embarks on a journey from a low-ranking disciple to a powerful immortal. This complete edition collects both Book 1 (A Record of a Mortal&#x2019;s Journey to Immortality, 2,455 chapters) and Book 2 (Immortal Realm, 1,395 chapters), comprising the full work by Wang Yu.</dc:description>

